Package: wildvizR
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Data Visualization and Analysis in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sardys", "Avile-Martinez", email = "sardys.avile@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package provides functions that simplify data visualization 
    and statistical analysis using popular R packages such as ggplot2 and plyr. 
    It is designed to help users quickly explore, summarize, and visualize 
    datasets through reusable tools and clear visual output. Ideal for students 
    and analysts working on data-driven projects.
Depends: R (>= 3.1.2)
